## How to emulate PatternAuth app (requires iPhone 16 emulator)

1. Navigate to ios_app directory

`cd ~/.../Better-2FA/src/ios_app`

2. Boot iPhone 16 emulator (through VSCode extension or Xcode)

3. Build app through Xcode (for iPhone 16 emulator)

`xcodebuild -scheme PatternAuth -destination 'platform=iOS Simulator,name=iPhone 16' clean build`

5. Install app onto emulator

`xcrun simctl install booted ~/Library/Developer/Xcode/DerivedData/PatternAuth*/Build/Products/Debug-iphonesimulator/PatternAuth.app`

The PatternAuth app is now installed on the emulated iPhone 16. Navigate to the rightmost page and click to open it.

### Testing Only

Previous builds may interfere with future changes. Remove all previous builds from DerivedData folder with

`cd ~/Library/Developer/Xcode/DerivedData/; rm -r ./* `